// DetailString :
"P378537123" "According to legend, Hera gave this emerald necklace to one of Zeus' many mortal wives. When the girl put the necklace on, she was immediately engulfed in flames. In the millennia since, the necklace has often been used to enhance rituals of revenge."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
