"P2379023288" "The Paragon City Museum has reported the theft of an ancient artifact, the Jewel of Hera. I'd bet my life the Circle is behind it. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Will you recover the stolen jewel from the Circle of Thorns?</A>"
