"P265130517" "After interrogating several Circle mystics, you learned the locations of several of their bases. This information should help your contact resolve several outstanding missing person cases."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1523977463" "I'm working on a number of outstanding missing person cases, and I think I know who's responsible for them: the Circle of Thorns. If we only knew the location of more Circle bases, I'm sure we could find a lot of the people who have gone missing. I need you to hit the streets and interrogate as many Circle mystics as you can find. I need the locations of those bases!"
