// IntroString :
"P7707147" "There is an increase in Circle of Thorn activity in Kings Row. They are kidnapping citizens off the streets for use in their dark rituals. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need a hero who can get to Kings Row and stop the Circle kidnappings.</a> The Circle's rituals are performed only at night, and usually in secluded spots like building rooftops to avoid unwanted attention, so start your search there."
// AcceptString :
"P2698664408" "Go to Kings Row and stop the Circle kidnappings"
// SendOffString :
"P1810820980" "If I were you, I'd start looking for mystics in the Gish, Royal Refinery, or maybe High Park. The Circle prefers the seclusion of rooftops and back alleys for their rituals."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1327257055" "Combat Circle in Kings Row"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1282712687" "You haven't done enough to discourage the Circle from kidnapping the citizens of Kings Row."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3654258340" "You have put a stop to the Circle's kidnappings in Kings Row."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3210915587" "I've got a number of heroes following up those missing person cases; by putting a stop to the kidnappings, you've made their jobs a whole lot easier."
